@startuml
[*] --> Unregistered
Unregistered --> Registration : create account
Registration --> Validation : validate registration
Validation --> LoggedIn : login
LoggedIn --> TicketStatus : check ticket status
LoggedIn --> Booking : book ticket
Booking --> Payment : confirm and pay
LoggedIn --> AccountManagement : manage account details
AccountManagement --> LoggedOut : logout
TicketStatus --> LoggedOut : logout
Payment --> LoggedOut : logout
Booking --> LoggedOut : logout
AccountManagement --> LoggedIn : save changes
LoggedOut --> Unregistered : logout
@enduml
